{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Куу дүйнө опаасыз,", "text": "Куу дүйнө опаасыз,", "en": "This vain world is faithless,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Жалгандыгы билинип,", "text": "Жалгандыгы билинип,", "en": "Its falseness became known,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Чынын жалган түшүнүп,", "text": "Чынын жалган түшүнүп,", "en": "Taking truth itself for falsehood,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Калы каарын чачкан соң,", "text": "Калы каарын чачкан соң,", "en": "After the khan poured out his wrath,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Канча чагар кан барбы,", "text": "Канча чагар кан барбы,", "en": "Was there any khan who could answer back?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Кабак серпип, тиш кайрап,", "text": "Кабак серпип, тиш кайрап,", "en": "Flicking his brow and grinding his teeth,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Каяша берер ал барбы,", "text": "Каяша берер ал барбы,", "en": "Who had the strength to answer him?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Сүйлөбөй куу тил жайланып,", "text": "Сүйлөбөй куу тил жайланып,", "en": "Without speaking, the crafty tongue fell still,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Арканы жок, жиби жок,", "text": "Арканы жок, жиби жок,", "en": "Though there was neither rope nor cord,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Амалсыз кол, бут байланып,", "text": "Амалсыз кол, бут байланып,", "en": "Helpless, his hands and feet were bound,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Теңир уран заарымдан,", "text": "Теңир уран заарымдан,", "en": "From Tengir’s battle cry and venom,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Теңдиги жок оюмду,", "text": "Теңдиги жок оюмду,", "en": "My thought that has no equal,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Кайрып келген чын жайда,", "text": "Кайрып келген чын жайда,", "en": "Returning again to the true matter,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Арманга болуп карамдуу,", "text": "Арманга болуп карамдуу,", "en": "Grief-stricken and sorrowful,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Айдаган башка ой калбай,", "text": "Айдаган башка ой калбай,", "en": "With no other thought left to pursue,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Турган экен Желжетпес.", "text": "Турган экен Желжетпес.", "en": "There stood Jeljetpes.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Арман кылып көз жайнап,", "text": "Арман кылып көз жайнап,", "en": "Lamenting, his eyes shone,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Санаа санга бөлүнүп,", "text": "Санаа санга бөлүнүп,", "en": "His care divided into countless cares,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Каары тозок Чың Темир,", "text": "Каары тозок Чың Темир,", "en": "Chyng Temir, whose wrath was hell,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Жалаңкыч түрү көрүнүп,", "text": "Жалаңкыч түрү көрүнүп,", "en": "Appeared in a fearsome aspect,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Жалынган менен жан калбайт,", "text": "Жалынган менен жан калбайт,", "en": "Though one begged, no life would be spared,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l034", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 34, "raw": "Жалбарган менен ал калбайт.", "text": "Жалбарган менен ал калбайт.", "en": "Though one pleaded, none would remain.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l035", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 35, "raw": "Ата карап, эне тууган,", "text": "Ата карап, эне тууган,", "en": "Born of a father and mother,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: ambiguous cursive letterforms, archaic vocabulary, or a material variant from the printed continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf069:l036", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 69, "folio": 452, "line_in_page": 36, "raw": "Жаралган пенде өлбөйбү.", "text": "Жаралган пенде өлбөйбү.", "en": "What created mortal does not die?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
